= Bosses
There are three bosses scattered throughout the map which can be approched and killed in any order.
Each boss has a mechanic that afflicts the player.
When a boss is killed, its mechanic ends, but the mechanics of the other bosses intensify.
The mechanics are as follows.

== Bombardment
The boss targets a series of semi-random tiles on the ground.
At the end of the next enemy phase, player units at the targeted tiles are damaged and enemy units at the targeted tiles are healed.
The number of tiles targeted and the frequency of this effect increase as the effect intensifies.

== Armaments
The boss targets enemy units near the player's forces and grants them a temporary slayer skill.
The number of targets increases as the effect intensifies.

== Reinforcements
THe boss periodically animates constructs which drop no corpses or soul juice when slain.
The strength of the constructs and frequency of summoning increases as the effect intensifies.

